{"baseRefName":"main","body":"## Summary\n- refresh the Phase 0 stable-release aggregate to audited main commit `a11d91d8256bc10beb2e6ca3dc005a15f438bf01` after PR #697\n- retain the current blocked aggregate verdict: 6/13 required gates closed, 7 runtime/product gates still open, blocked, or insufficient\n- add the after-697 evidence bundle with merged PR snapshots through PR #697, current-main workflow snapshots, checksums, and the recommended next README open gate\n\n## Result\n- `phase0-stable-release-summary.json`: `aggregate_verdict=blocked`, `can_mark_phase0_stable_release=false`\n- source, owner PR, and merged PR guards pass for the audited source\n- blocking required gates remain: macOS Host hardware compatibility matrix, telemetry/external latency archive, Host RSS 2h no-growth, native pointer HID mouse, controller runtime, clipboard product E2E, and file-transfer product E2E\n- next README open gate to advance: `macos_host_hardware_compatibility_matrix`\n\n## Verification\n- `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 PYTHONPATH=tools python3 -m unittest tools.tests.test_phase0_module_ownership tools.tests.test_phase0_stable_release -v` -> 112 tests OK\n- `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 -m unittest tests.phase3.test_repository_privacy.RepositoryPrivacyTests.test_current_tree_has_no_raw_android_serial_contexts -v` -> OK\n- `make phase0-stable-release-gate PHASE0_STABLE_RELEASE_EXPECTED_SOURCE_COMMIT=$(git rev-parse HEAD) PHASE0_STABLE_RELEASE_SUMMARY=.build/evidence/phase0-stable-release/final-after-697-summary.json` -> blocked aggregate, source guard accepts this aggregate-only successor\n- `shasum -a 256 -c docs/changes/2026-08-22-phase0-stable-release-aggregate/evidence/2026-09-08-after-697-current-main-gate-blocked/SHA256SUMS` -> all OK\n- `git diff --check` -> OK\n\n## Boundaries\n- No Vibe Screen, MacHost, or Telemachus GUI was launched.\n- No `swift run`, Screen Recording, Accessibility, Microphone, Keychain, TCC, System Settings, or signing state change was performed.\n- No `adb reverse tcp:54321 tcp:54321` mapping was created.\n- This PR does not mark Phase 0 stable, complete, shipped, or closed.\n\n","closedAt":"2026-09-08T11:48:28Z","files":[{"path":"README.md","additions":2,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-phase0-stable-release-aggregate/README.md","additions":40,"deletions":21,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-phase0-stable-release-aggregate/evidence/2026-09-08-after-697-current-main-gate-blocked/README.md","additions":96,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-phase0-stable-release-aggregate/evidence/2026-09-08-after-697-current-main-gate-blocked/SHA256SUMS","additions":28,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-phase0-stable-release-aggregate/evidence/2026-09-08-after-697-current-main-gate-blocked/closed-prs-568-697.json","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-phase0-stable-release-aggregate/evidence/2026-09-08-after-697-current-main-gate-blocked/commands.txt","additions":20,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-phase0-stable-release-aggregate/evidence/2026-09-08-after-697-current-main-gate-blocked/github-run-34219041989.json","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-phase0-stable-release-aggregate/evidence/2026-09-08-after-697-current-main-gate-blocked/github-run-34219042065.json","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-phase0-stable-release-aggregate/evidence/2026-09-08-after-697-current-main-gate-blocked/github-run-34219042080.json","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-phase0-stable-release-aggregate/evidence/2026-09-08-after-697-current-main-gate-blocked/head.txt","additions":18,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-phase0-stable-release-aggregate/evidence/2026